The function has two helper methods, `is_markdown_token_at()` and `extract_matching_html_tag()`. The former identifies whether the current character position refers to a relevant Markdown element. The latter iteratively searches through the input string for instances of known Markdown syntax patterns and attempts to parse those fragments into the corresponding HTML format. 

